Description: graphical time-series monitor for Intel GPUs
 A GTK 4 / libadwaita front-end for intel_gpu_top, in the style of GNOME
 System Monitor. It plots engine utilisation (Render/3D, Blitter, Video,
 VideoEnhance, Compute), GPU frequency, power draw, RC6 residency, memory
 bandwidth and interrupts as scrolling graphs and lists the processes that
 use the GPU.
